# Question 5: Copy-on-Write (COW) Fork
# Makefile integration snippet for xv6-public

# Add _cowtest to UPROGS in xv6 Makefile:
# UPROGS=\
#   _cat\
#   _echo\
#   _forktest\
#   _grep\
#   _init\
#   _kill\
#   _ln\
#   _ls\
#   _mkdir\
#   _rm\
#   _sh\
#   _stressfs\
#   _usertests\
#   _wc\
#   _zombie\
#   _cowtest\

# Add cowtest.c to EXTRA:
# EXTRA=\
#   cowtest.c\

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy mmu.h, kalloc.c, vm.c, trap.c to xv6/
# 2. Copy cowtest.c to xv6/
# 3. make clean && make qemu-nox
# 4. Run `cowtest`
